{"id":"631506","name":"空气炸锅烤薯角","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/631506/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小土豆","amount":"5个"}],"sub":[{"name":"五香粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"一小勺"},{"name":"橄榄油","amount":"一小勺"},{"name":"孜然","amount":"适量"},{"name":"欧芹碎","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆去皮清洗一下。","img":"images/631506/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把土豆切成船状。","img":"images/631506/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入一勺橄榄油。","img":"images/631506/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入一小勺食盐。","img":"images/631506/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量五香粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/631506/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"撒上少许孜然，放入空气炸锅内。","img":"images/631506/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"°烤20分钟，中途可以翻一下。","img":"images/631506/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烤成这种表面微焦的样子就可以了。","img":"images/631506/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/631506/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上少许欧芹碎装饰。","img":"images/631506/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"可以直接吃或者蘸番茄酱。","img":"images/631506/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"非常美味。","img":"images/631506/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"赶快试试吧。","img":"images/631506/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"我先吃了。","img":"images/631506/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：空气炸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}